{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/3fa36467449dd30e0b817dcada0483d9.avif?t=1770821079\" width=777 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f About Alberoqui Side:\ud83c\udf1f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story of <strong>Alberoqui,</strong> a young man from a <strong>cursed clan</strong> searching for a way to reverse his fate before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of <strong>nostalgic pixel art</strong>, reminiscent of the classics you love, a dark battle is being waged. The most dangerous enemies are those that <i>whisper in your mind.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth behind these attacks: <strong>supernatural forces from a spiritual world that feed on human despair.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Your Journey Will Feature:\ud83c\udf1f</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FRIEND UNTIL THE END:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jesus</strong> will be by your side \u2014 not as a distant or religious figure, but as a loyal companion guiding you through your darkest moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/11fba895f3b8d120ecb87726d4dc6a7b.poster.avif?t=1770821079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/11fba895f3b8d120ecb87726d4dc6a7b.webm?t=1770821079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/11fba895f3b8d120ecb87726d4dc6a7b.mp4?t=1770821079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACTION AND REFLEXES:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive enemy turns by relying on sharp reflexes.</strong> Dodge complex attack patterns in a fast-paced, action-driven combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/9f7706cc92b0fbe6d87769def649bb74.poster.avif?t=1770821079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/9f7706cc92b0fbe6d87769def649bb74.webm?t=1770821079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/9f7706cc92b0fbe6d87769def649bb74.mp4?t=1770821079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STRATEGIC EMOTIONAL RESPONSES:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your turn, analyze each enemy and <strong>choose the right action</strong> to weaken them: Laugh, Ignore, Stay Calm\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/e019c5ffc467becd1806558b81b762bb.poster.avif?t=1770821079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/e019c5ffc467becd1806558b81b762bb.webm?t=1770821079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/e019c5ffc467becd1806558b81b762bb.mp4?t=1770821079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOURNEY COMPANIONS:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel alongside allies who provide support and companionship through your toughest moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/8649fda2b9bc066d80284cc9ba7d6e06.poster.avif?t=1770821079\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/8649fda2b9bc066d80284cc9ba7d6e06.webm?t=1770821079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/8649fda2b9bc066d80284cc9ba7d6e06.mp4?t=1770821079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUMOR IN THE DARKNESS:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well-timed <strong>joke</strong> can lighten even the darkest moments\u2026 or make them darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/fcdfabf99e05e5a8d3caa931ebe2e41b.avif?t=1770821079\" width=675 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAND-DRAWN ART:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with unique character portraits, crafted by hand with pencils and ink for a truly personal touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORATION AND PUZZLES:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use key items and solve puzzles to uncover secrets and advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INNER PROGRESSION:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow not through levels, but through inner maturation that follows the journey of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERSONAL JOURNEY:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gripping main story filled with twists, discoveries, and unforgettable moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DARK CREATURES:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural beings lurk in the shadows, waiting to test your courage and your mind. Can you survive their gaze?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560820?t=1770821079","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/d81de8152efebb1699f36cb2266e5a4085679fd8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770821079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/24d92310660deddbac454f740cd109aed10ef4c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770821079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/24d92310660deddbac454f740cd109aed10ef4c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770821079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4197540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/3fa36467449dd30e0b817dcad